            "ImageDescription": {
              "value": "\u201cThe Golden Temple, Amritsar\u201d by Edwin Weeks, 1890.\n<p>Very similar to a lot on sale at Bonhams' India in Art sale in New Bond Street, London. Sale 7th June 2022. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.alamy.com/london-uk-30th-may-2022-american-painter-edwin-lord-weeks-1849-1903-expresses-the-magnificence-of-the-golden-temple-at-amritsar-in-the-eponymous-oil-painting-estimated-at-100000-150000-a-preview-of-bonhams-india-in-art-sale-in-new-bond-street-the-sale-takes-place-on-7th-june-2022-credit-guy-bellalamy-live-news-image471177096.html\">reference</a> Their version has two crows in it.\n</p><p>Edwin Lord Weeks, <i>Across the Pool to the Golden Temple of Amritsar</i>, circa 1882-1883. Courtesy of Taylor/Graham and TEFAF New York.\n</p>\nURL: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/CF4WyexsRsv/\">https://www.instagram.com/p/CF4WyexsRsv/</a>",
